# Keep this minimal. The build embeds files from docs/, fixtures/,
# tests/fixtures/, and flake.lock via include_str!/include_bytes!, so
# excluding those breaks compilation in ways that only show up as
# missing-file errors from rustc.
#
# The scratch patterns below are safe: no include_*! references any
# tarball, image, or scratch directory, and together they cut the build
# context by hundreds of MB (working-tree bundles accumulate at the root).
target/
.git/
result
result-*
.DS_Store
*.tar.gz
*.tar
*.png
.claude/
.tonepoet_chunk2_backups/
chunk2*/
IMPLEMENTATION_REPORT_*.md
PR1_REVIEW_COMMENT.md
